      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "setup: source enable-testbench.sh →   → TESTBENCH_MODE=enabled → seed plugins/malicious-plugin → cd victim-app (plugin-active.js) → write infrastructure/mock-server.js\nmock: node infrastructure/mock-server.js · listen http://localhost:3018 · init captured-data.json {captures:[]} · POST /collect · GET /captured-data · DELETE /captured-data\nlab: cd victim-app && npm start ·   → run-plugin-install → installHook · check .infected-by-plugin marker\nsteps: 1. Learner→Victim: npm start (plugin registered in .npmrc / config) · 2. Victim→MalPkg: malicious-plugin intercepts install lifecycle · 3. MalPkg→MalPkg: Modify / observe target-lib resolution (simulated) · 4. Learner→Victim: Observe capture + plugin logs",
      "fontSize": 12,
